            "marks": 8,
            "frequency": "Dec 2023, Dec 2021",
            "priority": "SUPER IMP",
            "answerHint": "When a process blocks, send probe(i, j, k) to all wait-for dependencies. If probe returns to initiator, cycle exists => Deadlock."
